    "author_association": "NONE",
    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [x] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [x] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n- [x] I have updated 'mini.nvim' to latest version of the `main` branch\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.basics\n\n### Neovim version\n\n0.12 (!at least latest Nightly build!)\n\n### Description\n\nWhen settings `mappings=false` in the settings (as indicated in the docs), I get an error: \n```\n(mini.basics) `mappings` should be table, not boolean\n```\n\n### Reproduction\n\nMinimal init.lua:\n```\nvim.pack.add({\"https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim\"})\nrequire(\"mini.basics\").setup({ mappings = false })\n```",
