            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "The error message describes the source of the error: `config.mappings` should be table. The [set to `false` to disable](https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/blob/b5bae7dd5802b47bb03babfb374fdfdab02b9d8b/doc/mini-basics.txt#L92-L106) is meant for each field. Maybe \"set field to `false` to disable\" might be more informative. I'll adjust it.",
